     <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2020</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">9</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">27</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">日，浙江省物理学会公示了《第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">37</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届全国中学生奥林匹克物理竞赛（浙江赛区）省队名单》和《第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">37</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届全国中学生奥林匹克物理竞赛（浙江赛区）一等奖名单》。绍兴一中</span></span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">周天宇、刘宇政</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">等</span></span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">位同学</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">进入浙江</span></span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">省队正式名单</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，周天宇、刘宇政、王一川、龚典乐、宋徐铭扬、何子墨、吴宇辰等</span></span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">7</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">位同学获得浙江赛区一等奖</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">。为绍兴一中的物理竞赛成绩树立了新的高度。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt"><span style="font-family:宋体"><strong>省队八</strong><strong>个</strong><strong>正式名额，一中占两席</strong></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">省物理学会公示的第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">37</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届全国物理竞赛浙江省省队，正式名单共</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">8</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人，绍兴一中、温州中学各有</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人，杭二中、镇海中学、金华一中、余杭区杭州二中树兰实验学校各有</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">1</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人。绍兴一中的周天宇、刘宇政分别以第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">和第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">5</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">的成绩进入</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">8</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人名单，他们将代表浙江省征战</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">10</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">24</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">日在长沙举行的全国物理竞赛决赛，冲击全国金牌。</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020092910013601.jpg" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">竞赛甘苦，学子说体会</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">在物理实验室，这群竞赛载誉归来的少年们，谈起竞赛的经历，都感慨万千。以全省第二名进入省队的周天宇说：</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">在考场上取得的每一分，背后都是我们刷过的一张张试卷，是老师讲解过的一道道题目，是我们的汗水浇铸，更是老师们的心血凝结。见过了大场面，展望之后的全国决赛和高考，我更真切地明白</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">‘</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">’</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">的深刻内涵！</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">另一位进入省队的同学刘宇政，则坚定地说，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">未来除了尽力绽放，没有第二条路</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">谈起这支团队的教练黄伟中老师和陈浩老师，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">7</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">位同学都表达了对老师们的感恩之情。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">他（黄伟中）看上去总是精力充沛，但其实我们都知道他是在透支自己，只是为了有更多的时间指导我们。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">刘宇政的话说出了同学们的心声。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们唯有用成绩回报黄伟中老师、陈浩老师和班主任的心血，回报学校的培育。省队后面的路，还要加倍努力。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">其他几位一等奖获得者也分享了自己竞赛之路的收获与感动：自主钻研、深度思考、抗压能力、时间管理、团队学习、感恩师友</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">……“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">竞赛让我体验奋斗的快意。准备复赛实验考试的那几天，一开始我写不好实验报告，交上去的实验报告，老师面批时，说我条理不清、不得要领。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">何子墨说，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">深夜回家的路上，想起屈原的诗句</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">‘</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">心郁郁之忧思兮，独永叹乎增伤</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">’</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，不禁流下泪来。是家人师友的陪伴和鼓励给了我力量。最终，我的实验考试不仅没有拖后腿，反而还提升了我的整体名次。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020092910015067.jpg" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">名科建设，竞赛结硕果</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">一直以来，绍兴一中致力于挖掘学生的学科特长，做强优质学生的特色发展。学校通过建设特长生培养课程体系和竞赛辅导体系，以创新班学习课程为载体，来进一步提高学生的学科素养，实现全面发展、优长发展。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴一中的物理学科作为市级特色学科，教研组和竞赛辅导团队已先后多次培育学子在全国竞赛中夺金。算上本次的省队名额，绍兴一中已经先后有</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">7</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">位同学进入浙江省队，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">4</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">位同学进入国家集训队。宣佩琪同学荣获第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">22</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届（</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">1991</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年）国际物理奥林匹克竞赛金牌，这是迄今为止绍兴大市物理竞赛的最好成绩；吴宇恺同学荣获第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">12</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届（</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2011</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年）亚洲物理竞赛第一名，这是迄今为止绍兴大市物理竞赛的次好成绩；蔡格非同学以高二学子的身份跻身第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">34</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届（</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2017</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年）全国中学生物理竞赛集训队，提前一年迈入北大校园，绍兴大市第一人。竞赛团队也多次在比赛中获团体优胜，屡次取得绍兴大市第一的优异成绩。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">成绩背后离不开学子们的拼搏与进取，更少不了竞赛老师们的坚守与付出。在此，对本次竞赛的获奖同学表示热烈祝贺！对竞赛辅导团队的黄伟中老师、陈浩老师、朱玛莉老师表示感谢！感谢各班主任与任课老师的支持！尤其是</span><span style="font-family:宋体">向上述获奖学子的初中母校绍兴市第一初级中学、绍兴市元培中学、绍兴市建功中学、绍兴市东湖中学城东部等初中学校报喜，感谢各校为我校输送了优秀人才。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
